    "description": "Facing the Caribbean Sea, this relaxed hotel is 5 km from the Aquarium de la Guadeloupe and 10 km from Golf des Abymes.\nLow-key, colorful rooms offer minifridges, free Wi-Fi and satellite TV, plus balconies with garden or sea views. The 1-bedroom apartments feature kitchenettes, living rooms and terraces.\nParking is free, and breakfast is available. There are 2 beachfront restaurants (1 featuring Creole cuisine) and a bar. Recreational facilities include an outdoor pool, tennis courts, ping-pong tables and a pétanque court, as well as beach volleyball. There's also a water sports center and a kids' club."
